content_en:
Recently, we've noticed that some developers used the 'Code Upload' method for game submissions, but the files we received were incomplete or corrupted. We've identified the likely causes: specific code format rejections, or submitting the form before the upload progress finished.

To fix this, we've updated the submission form with the following improvements:
1. 📦 Code submissions now require uploading a zip/rar archive;
2. 📝 Added a 'Single File Code Paste' option for small codebases;
3. 📧 If your archive is too large, please send it directly to our official email.

💡 Friendly Reminder: We will send an email notification after processing your submission. Please make sure to check your Spam/Junk folder and look out for official emails from [leleleling Studio] so you don't miss any important updates!
